  ('basketball', 'published', 'Texas A&M Basketball Seasons Tip Off at Reed Arena Next Week', '<p>COLLEGE STATION — Both Texas A&amp;M basketball teams open their regular seasons at Reed Arena next week. The women''s team hosts Arkansas Pine Bluff on Monday, Nov. 2, and the men''s team hosts Alabama State at 7 p.m. Tuesday, Nov. 3, according to Texas A&amp;M Athletics.</p><img src="/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs-sp-03.webp" alt="Reed Arena on the Texas A&amp;M campus during a men&#x27;s basketball game in the 2010-11 season (file photo, 2010-11). Photo: Mikerussell / Wikimedia Commons (CC BY-SA 3.0)"><p><em>▲ Reed Arena on the Texas A&amp;M campus during a men''s basketball game in the 2010-11 season (file photo, 2010-11). Photo: Mikerussell / Wikimedia Commons (CC BY-SA 3.0)</em></p><p>The men played their only preseason exhibition Sunday, losing 94-88 at SMU in Dallas. PJ Haggerty scored 28 points for the Aggies on 10-for-15 shooting and added four assists and four steals. Jordan Pope scored 15, and Mackenzie Mgbako had 12 points and a team-high eight rebounds, the athletics department said.</p><p>Texas A&amp;M led 67-57 with 9:04 left after a 14-2 run, but SMU went ahead 84-82 with 38 seconds left and made nine straight free throws in the final 26 seconds. The Aggies made 32 of 40 free throws and forced 20 SMU turnovers.</p><p>"What we''ve got to do is stop fouling," head coach Bucky McMillan said after the game, according to remarks posted by the athletics department. "This is practice for us right now and we''re learning from it."</p><p>Haggerty, who transferred from Kansas State, was named to the media''s Preseason All-SEC Third Team on Oct. 12. He averaged 23.4 points per game last season, which ranked fourth nationally, according to the athletics department.</p><p>After the opener, the men''s schedule lists home games against Northern Kentucky on Nov. 6, ULM on Nov. 9, Oklahoma State on Nov. 12 and Southeastern Louisiana on Nov. 16, followed by a Nov. 19 game at TCU and Battle 4 Atlantis games in the Bahamas against Xavier on Nov. 25 and Marquette on Nov. 27.</p><p>The women''s team, in coach Joni Taylor''s fifth season, plays 10 nonconference games at Reed Arena, including Louisiana on Nov. 5 and LSU New Orleans on Nov. 7, the school said in September. The Nov. 18 game against East Texas A&amp;M is the program''s annual Elementary School Day game, and the Nov. 16 game against Lamar is scheduled as part of a doubleheader with the men''s team.</p><p>Speaking at the SEC''s preseason media event in October, McMillan said, "it''s about to be a time for doing, not a time for talking here in a couple weeks."</p><p><em>※ This article was written with the help of AI, based on public and official sources.</em></p>', 'The Texas A&M women open Nov. 2 against Arkansas Pine Bluff and the men host Alabama State on Nov. 3, both at Reed Arena. The men lost a 94-88 exhibition at SMU on Sunday.', '/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs-sp-03.webp', '2026-10-26T08:10:00-05:00'::timestamptz, array['Texas A&M basketball','Reed Arena','PJ Haggerty','Bucky McMillan','Joni Taylor']::text[], '• 확인할 점: Women''s opener tip time and TV were ''to be announced'' in the Sept. 21 release; check the 12thman.com women''s schedule and add the time if posted.
• 확인할 점: McMillan exhibition quote is two excerpts from the same printed postgame answer (''...You can''t do that. So again, this is practice for us right now...''); the second excerpt starts mid-sentence after ''So again,''.
• 확인할 점: Haggerty was also named to the Jerry West Shooting Guard of the Year preseason watch list, announced Tuesday afternoon, Oct. 27 — after this story''s publish time, so left out. Can be added in an update.
• 확인할 점: McMillan''s quote at SEC Tipoff from the 12thman.com page (Oct. 14). The release notes the event was held outside Birmingham; I did not name the exact venue.
• 확인할 점: Men''s TV listings (SEC Network+ for the opener) are from the schedule page and were left out of the body.
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — Aggies Fall to SMU, 94-88, in Preseason Exhibition (Oct. 25, 2026)): https://12thman.com/news/2026/10/25/aggies-fall-to-smu-94-88-in-preseason-exhibition
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — 2026-27 Men''s Basketball Schedule (accessed Oct. 27, 2026)): https://12thman.com/sports/mens-basketball/schedule
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — Haggerty Selected to Media Preseason All-SEC Third Team (Oct. 12, 2026)): https://12thman.com/news/2026/10/12/haggerty-selected-to-preseason-all-sec-third-team-by-media
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — Women''s Basketball Announces Non-Conference Schedule (Sept. 21, 2026)): https://12thman.com/news/2026/09/21/womens-basketball-announces-non-conference-schedule
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — Bucky McMillan Meets Media at SEC Basketball Tipoff (Oct. 14, 2026)): https://12thman.com/news/2026/10/14/bucky-mcmillan-meets-media-at-sec-basketball-tipoff
• 이용 조건: Text: original writing based on facts from Texas A&M Athletics releases; quotes as printed by Texas A&M Athletics / Photo: CC BY-SA 3.0, Mikerussell, File:Reed Arena, College Station, TxA&M campus.jpg (2535x1901)
